# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied into the export as-is, like `_headers`.

# English lives at the root, not under a prefix — `/vs-multica`, not
# `/en/vs-multica`. Nothing on the site links to `/en/…`, but readers and
# crawlers guess it once they've seen `/zh/…` and `/fr/…`, and it would
# otherwise 404. Send them to the page they meant.
/en / 301
/en/* /:splat 301

# `/docs/spec-skills` became `/docs/agents` when a spec skill became a spec agent.
/docs/spec-skills /docs/agents 301

# `goal.md` gave way to `product.md`, which the board writes itself.
/docs/what-makes-a-good-goal /docs 301

# The recipes were taken down; scheduled agents are what replaced them.
/recipes /docs/agents 301
/recipes/* /docs/agents 301

# The triage endpoint contract was taken down; Triage covers the ways items arrive.
/docs/triage-endpoint /docs/triage 301

# The GitHub Issues and Linear comparisons were taken down.
/vs-github-issues / 301
/vs-github-issues.md / 301
/vs-linear / 301
/vs-linear.md / 301
/zh/vs-github-issues /zh 301
/zh/vs-linear /zh 301
/es/vs-github-issues /es 301
/es/vs-linear /es 301
/ja/vs-github-issues /ja 301
/ja/vs-linear /ja 301
/fr/vs-github-issues /fr 301
/fr/vs-linear /fr 301
